L0281: Unsupported or unresolved generic instantiation

The generic template cannot be specialized under the current rules: a bound, type argument, inference result or instantiation budget is invalid. Supply explicit supported type arguments and Logical bounds where required. Templates are checked at concrete instantiations, not assumed universally valid.

Example from `tests/corpus/reject/generic_bound.lc`; the full file is a regression test.

```locus
struct Wrapper<T: Debug> { value: T }
```

Language, as built: [1.3:3](../../atlas.html#/doc/language/spec-1.3:3).
